# Use the HTTPS endpoint reported by `aspire describe` for the web resource.
# Health endpoints are exposed in Development only. This starter ships no JSON
# API yet; add requests here as endpoints are added. Signing in and POSTs need
# the Identity and antiforgery cookies from the same client - never commit them.
@baseUrl = https://localhost:REPLACE_WITH_ASPIRE_PORT

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/alive

### Readiness, including the database check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Home
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Sign in
GET {{baseUrl}}/Account/Login

### Register
GET {{baseUrl}}/Account/Register

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
